<title>UK: World rubber stocks rose in January.</title>
<headline>World rubber stocks rose in January.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1997-06-05</dateline>
<text>
<p>World stocks of natural rubber rose in January from the previous month, latest data from the International Rubber Study Group showed.</p>
<p>Data in thousand tonnes --  JAN'97  DEC'96  JAN'96</p>
<p>Natural production		  590     560     590</p>
<p>Natural consumption		 560     530     520</p>
<p>Natural stocks		    1,630   1,600   1,650</p>
<p>Synthetic production		840     820     810</p>
<p>Synthetic consumption	     810     790     790</p>
<p>Synthetic stocks		  2,530   2,500   2,480</p>
<p>London Newsroom, +44 171 542 7771</p>
</text>
